#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:201
msgid ""
"The following custom Trusted Publisher issuers have been configured for this"
" organization. These issuers can be used to configure Trusted Publishing for"
" your organization's projects."
msgstr ""
"Följande utfärdare för anpassade betrodda utgivare har konfigurerats för "
"denna organisation. Dessa utfärdare kan användas för att konfigurera betrodd"
" publicering för organisationens projekt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:216
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please contact <a href=%(href)s>PyPI Support</a> if you need to modify "
"custom Trusted Publishers."
msgstr ""
"Kontakta <a href=%(href)s>PyPI:s support</a> om du behöver ändra anpassade "
"betrodda utgivare."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:228
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please contact <a href=%(href)s>PyPI Support</a> if you need to rename your "
"organization."
msgstr ""
"Kontakta <a href=%(href)s>PyPI:s support</a> om du behöver byta namn på "
"organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:285
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(transfer_href)s\">transfer ownership</a> and <a "
"href=\"%(remove_delete_href)s\">remove project</a> <b>or</b> <a "
"href=\"%(remove_delete_href)s\">delete project</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(transfer_href)s\">överföra ägarskapet</a> och <a "
"href=\"%(remove_delete_href)s\">ta bort projektet</a> <b>eller</b> <a "
"href=\"%(remove_delete_href)s\">ta bort projektet permanent</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:304
msgid ""
"Your subscription will be cancelled, and you will lose access to the billing"
" portal."
msgstr ""
"Prenumerationen avslutas och du förlorar åtkomsten till "
"faktureringsportalen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:308
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please ensure you have retrieved all invoices from <a "
"href=\"%(billing_href)s\">your billing portal</a> before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att du har hämtat alla fakturor från <a "
"href=\"%(billing_href)s\">faktureringsportalen</a> innan du fortsätter."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/teams.html:52
msgid ""
"There are no teams in your organization, yet. Organization owners and "
"managers can create new teams for the organization."
msgstr ""
"Det finns ännu inga team i organisationen. Organisationens ägare och "
"administratörer kan skapa nya team."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/teams.html:76
msgid ""
"Owners and managers of this organization can create a team for the "
"organization and manage team members, team projects, and team settings."
msgstr ""
"Ägare och administratörer för denna organisation kan skapa ett team och "
"hantera teamets medlemmar, projekt och inställningar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/documentation.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you would like to DESTROY any existing documentation hosted at <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">%(url)s</a> there is <strong>no</strong> undo, as uploading"
" new documentation is no longer supported."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill TA BORT befintlig dokumentation som finns på <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">%(url)s</a> går det <strong>inte</strong> att ångra, "
"eftersom det inte längre går att ladda upp ny dokumentation."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/history.html:11
msgid ""
"Each time you (or your collaborators) perform a security action related to "
"this project, the action is recorded and displayed here."
msgstr ""
"Varje gång du eller dina medarbetare utför en säkerhetsåtgärd som rör detta "
"projekt registreras åtgärden och visas här."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/history.html:137
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> invited to join as project "
"%(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har bjudits in som %(role_name)s för "
"projektet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/history.html:144
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> declined invitation to join as project"
" %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har avböjt inbjudan som %(role_name)s "
"för projektet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/history.html:151
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Revoked invitation for <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> to join as "
"project %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"Återkallade inbjudan för <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> att ansluta "
"som %(role_name)s för projektet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/manage_project_base.html:53
msgid ""
"PyPI Admins need to review this project before it can be restored. While in "
"quarantine, the project is not installable by clients, and cannot be being "
"modified by its maintainers."
msgstr ""
"PyPI:s administratörer måste granska projektet innan det kan återställas. "
"Medan projektet är i karantän kan klienter inte installera det och "
"underhållarna kan inte ändra det."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/manage_project_base.html:60
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:46
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Read more in the <a href=\"%(href)s\">project in quarantine</a> help "
"article."
msgstr "Läs mer i hjälpartikeln <a href=\"%(href)s\">projekt i karantän</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:9
msgid ""
"Some form fields have been autofilled, please double-check their values "
"before submitting the form."
msgstr ""
"Vissa formulärfält har fyllts i automatiskt. Kontrollera värdena innan du "
"skickar formuläret."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:258
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The subject is the numeric ID that represents the principal making the "
"request. While not required, providing the subject further restricts the "
"identity which is used for publishing. <a href=\"%(href)s\">More details "
"here.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Subjektet är det numeriska ID som representerar den huvudman som gör "
"begäran. Det är inte obligatoriskt men om du anger subjektet begränsas "
"identiteten som används för publicering ytterligare. <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">Mer information finns här.</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:436
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you currently use multiple environments in your CI/CD workflows, you must"
" either change them all to '%(constrained_environment_name)s' or register "
"each as a Trusted Publisher."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder flera miljöer i dina CI/CD-arbetsflöden måste du antingen "
"ändra dem alla till '%(constrained_environment_name)s' eller registrera var "
"och en som betrodd utgivare."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:448
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I understand that this Trusted Publisher will only allow uploads from CI/CD "
"workflows running in the '%(constrained_environment_name)s' environment."
msgstr ""
"Jag förstår att denna betrodda utgivare bara tillåter uppladdningar från "
"CI/CD-arbetsflöden som körs i miljön '%(constrained_environment_name)s'."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:38
msgid ""
"PyPI Admins need to review this release before it can be restored. While in "
"quarantine, the release is not installable by clients, and cannot be "
"modified by its maintainers. Other releases of this project are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"PyPI:s administratörer måste granska utgåvan innan den kan återställas. "
"Medan utgåvan är i karantän kan klienter inte installera den och "
"underhållarna kan inte ändra den. Andra utgåvor av projektet påverkas inte."
